title: "geez-dataset"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
abstract: "Classical Ge'ez morphology: gold verb paradigms from Merho Ges Wesewasew Ze-Yared, labelled forms from six other books in one schema, lexicon, Ge'ez-Amharic pairs and synthetic paradigms. Roots are split so that no root is in two of train, val and test."
type: dataset
